(Verse 1)
It started with a simple post, a line you wrote,
I didn’t know that night would change my world.
Your words were like a spark that lit the sky,
A fire I couldn’t fight, I had to try.

You liked my photo, and I liked your smile,
From comment threads, we stayed a while.
Conversations turned to midnight calls,
Falling faster than we thought we’d fall.

(Pre-Chorus)
Now every message feels like a touch,
Every emoji says way too much.
From a screen to a dream, here we are,
A digital love, but it’s more than stars.

(Chorus)
From a post to forever, we’re more than just words,
Aldo Arturo and Nidia, can’t believe what occurred.
What started in silence, now screams through the night,
We’re a love that’s crazy, but it feels so right.
From a post to forever, I found my way to you,
A passion that’s wild, a love that’s true.

(Verse 2)
Late nights, we shared secrets so deep,
You stole my heart, now it’s yours to keep.
Through the distance, we built our trust,
A love that feels so much more than just lust.

I remember the first time I saw your face,
In a video call, my heart raced.
Now I can’t imagine life without you near,
Your voice is the sound I need to hear.

(Pre-Chorus)
Now every message feels like a kiss,
Every moment is pure bliss.
From a post to a heartbeat we found,
In this crazy love, I’ll never back down.

(Chorus)
From a post to forever, we’re more than just words,
Aldo Arturo and Nidia, can’t believe what occurred.
What started in silence, now screams through the night,
We’re a love that’s crazy, but it feels so right.
From a post to forever, I found my way to you,
A passion that’s wild, a love that’s true.

(Bridge)
People said it’s just a phase,
But they don’t know the games we played.
Every text, every meme, every late-night dream,
You’re my everything, you’re my sweetest theme.

We broke the screen, now it’s you and me,
In this world so wild, we’re finally free.
Hand in hand, we walk this line,
Aldo and Nidia, love so divine.

(Chorus)
From a post to forever, we’re more than just words,
Aldo Arturo and Nidia, can’t believe what occurred.
What started in silence, now screams through the night,
We’re a love that’s crazy, but it feels so right.
From a post to forever, I found my way to you,
A passion that’s wild, a love that’s true.

(Outro)
Now every post I make, it’s for you,
Every song I write, it's love shining through.
From a comment to a kiss, from a text to this,
Aldo and Nidia, you’re my forever bliss.

From a post to forever, this love will stay,
